     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Prefixes, direction and aspectual pairs",
     "texto": [
      "A prefix can add direction or result, but it does not have a fixed translation for all verbs. Compare the meaning of the base verb with the prefixed verb within a sentence.",
      "**Wchodzić / wejść** describe going in as a process/habit or as a completed entry; **wychodzić / wyjść** describe going out. Other prefixes create lexical meanings that are best learned in context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
